async function download(format){await run('Saving & exporting…',async()=>{await saveInternal();const p=project();const params=new URLSearchParams({format,pageId:state.pageId,variantId:variant().id});const response=await api(`/api/projects/${encodeURIComponent(p.id)}/export?${params}`,{raw:true});const blob=await response.blob();const disposition=response.headers.get('Content-Disposition')||'';const serverName=disposition.match(/filename="?([^";]+)"?/i)?.[1];const extension=format.startsWith('zip-')?'zip':format==='html'?'html':'json';const name=(serverName||`${p.name.replace(/[^a-zA-Z0-9_-]/g,'-')||'mosaic'}-${format}.${extension}`).replace(/[\/\\\x00-\x1f]/g,'_');const url=URL.createObjectURL(blob);const a=node('a');a.href=url;a.download=name;document.body.append(a);a.click();a.remove();setTimeout(()=>URL.revokeObjectURL(url),15000);$('#modal').close();toast(`Downloaded the saved revision ${p.revision}.`);});}
